Revision history for Task-BeLike-GETTY

{{$NEXT}}
  - Ship a LICENSE file with the Perl 5 licence text and a Changes file
    that records the earlier releases.
  - Test every push on GitHub Actions; the job installs the whole list and
    so proves that every module in it still resolves on CPAN.

20150205.000  2015-02-05 04:25:20Z
  - Add Path::Tiny, JSON::MaybeXS, Yeb, Syccess, Installer, Twiggy, PocketIO
    and the CSS/JavaScript minifiers.
  - Follow the plugin bundle to its new name,
    Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::GETTY.
  - Drop Template Toolkit, FCGI, JSON::XS, Catalyst::Plugin::AutoCRUD and
    Test::LoadAllModules, and the minimum versions of most entries.

20130420.000  2013-04-20 23:23:48Z
  - Drop Template::Stash::XS, which is not a distribution of its own.

20121001.001  2012-10-01 03:35:47Z
  - Grow the list to the Catalyst, DBIx::Class, templating, validation,
    translation, testing and DarkPAN tools in daily use.

20121001.000  2012-10-01 02:14:01Z
  - First release: Moo and Moose, Reflex, DBIx::Class, Plack and Web::Simple,
    Dist::Zilla with the GETTY plugin bundle, and the CPAN tooling around it.
